        "created": "2026-04-10T18:18:00-07:00"
      },
      {
        "rating": 1,
        "title": "Very inaccurate",
        "body": "The app was extremely inaccurate the entire Artemis 2 mission and I feel\nLike I blew 5$ down the drain",
        "reviewer": "Paytisa",
