      },
      {
        "rating": 1,
        "title": "Terrible delay",
        "body": "This app was delayed by more than 19 minutes. Watching the news was 10/15 minutes faster than when I would get a notification from the app. Parachutes deployed notification was so delayed , the astronauts were IRL already getting out of the capsule.",
        "reviewer": "thisis so dumb and theft",
        "territory": "USA",
        "created": "2026-04-10T17:24:29-07:00"
      },
      {
        "rating": 1,
        "title": "Really out of sync data",
        "body": "Got notifications for certain events happening during the mission way after it actually happened. We\u2019re talking 20/30 mins after each milestone. And data shown in app was always different to that of NASA so not sure what\u2019s going on there. Really annoying",
