        "territory": "GBR",
        "created": "2026-04-10T17:20:24-07:00"
      },
      {
        "rating": 5,
        "title": "this is a beautiful app",
        "body": "I truly am grateful to have ran across this beautiful app, totally worth the full price because of all the future missions. I love how it has live tracking down to miles and speed to a chance to see a live stream via youtube all from the same screen. Thank you for making this beautiful app! \ud83c\udf16\ud83d\ude80\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
